#. module: sale_purchase_inter_company
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_purchase_inter_company/models/sale_order.py:78
msgid ""
"You cannot create PO from SO because purchase currency is different than "
"sale order currency."
msgstr ""
"No pots crear una comanda de compra (PO) des d'una comanda de venda (SO) "
"perquè la moneda de compra és diferent de la moneda de la comanda de venda."

